   561	Status: proved under the stated public-exogenous protocol
   562	Assumptions: Horizon \(T=D+1\), \(q\in(0,1]\), two worlds \(\theta\in\{L,H\}\), no quote before \(P_1\), no same-period trade, public exogenous prices, and regret against the active world's best fixed quote. Profiles are per-world legal-decision profiles, not posterior or public-history predictability objects.
