    51	\[
    52	\mathcal R_G(\Theta)=\sup_{F\Subset\Theta}\mathcal R_G(F)=\sup_{F\Subset\Theta}\sup_{\pi\in\Delta(F)}\Psi_{G,F}(\pi).
